  <!-- EN: magic mushrooms -->
  <RC2_Shrooms.label>魔菇</RC2_Shrooms.label>
  <!-- EN: These 'magic' mushrooms, found only in the wild, cause the user to hallucinate and go on a 'trip' through what is often seen as a weird, strange reality. Not all of those who make it back are the same. Shrooms are a relatively safe drug - but users build up a tolerance for them very quickly.  Long-term users see an increased amount and severity of mental breaks the longer they use the drug - however, any sort of brain damage is extremely rare, and only if the user has a high level of the drug in their body for long periods of time. -->
  <RC2_Shrooms.description>这些“魔菇”仅生长于野外，会让使用者产生幻觉，并经历一场常被视为诡异、奇特的“幻境之旅”。能够平安归来的人，往往已不再是原来的自己。魔菇是一种相对安全的药物——但使用者会很快对其产生耐受性。  长期使用者会发现，随着使用时间的延长，精神崩溃的频率和严重程度都会增加——不过，任何形式的大脑损伤都极为罕见，且仅在使用者体内长期维持高浓度药物的情况下才会发生。</RC2_Shrooms.description>
</LanguageData>